# AI-Assisted: Claude Code (model: claude-opus-5) - Pinned line endings to LF everywhere.
# LF is part of a contract here, not a preference: curated-snapshot-format.md §1 requires LF
# and one trailing newline in every curated file, the bundle checksum is computed over bytes
# (FR-033, SC-006), and the detail-source fixture CSVs are byte-sensitive (a CRLF checkout
# would leave a stray CR in the last field of every record). A Windows curator with
# core.autocrlf=true must get the same bytes as CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.sqlite binary
